# Operador solo — execução agêntica

Leia [`docs/OPS_SOLO_OPERATOR_CHARTER.md`](../../docs/OPS_SOLO_OPERATOR_CHARTER.md) antes de orientar o Rafael a fazer trabalho técnico.

## Human (Rafael) — only

- Strategic product, architecture, and **policy** decisions — not code review or diff analysis.

## Agents — always

- Implementation, tests, docs ritual, commit, push, PR, CI fixes, **merge to `main`** when gates pass.
- Notebook ops (pull, migrations, restart, webhooks, `qa:run`) via agents/workers — **never** a manual checklist for Rafael.
- CH routine operations and CH «approve for merge» via API/automation — not human click.

## Do not say to the user

- «Faça merge», «revise a PR», «aprove G3», «rode no notebook…» as their task.

## Do say when needed

- One **decision** question (options + recommendation), then agents execute.
